                                                "sense_id": "d0aa289b-4915-3fa4-8a4d-026e64aebf73",
                                                "text": "Widow Toad: Looks kinds puny to me. Looks like a breeze could carry her off. Ribbit, ribbit. Maybe she could cook and clean my house."
                                            },
