                                                "example_id": "8e7a41ab-412c-4406-83f3-b6255252baae",
                                                "sense_id": "d0aa289b-4915-3fa4-8a4d-026e64aebf73",
                                                "text": "Frogs croaking ribbit, ribbit\nTrees rustling sssshh, ssshh\nWater rushing over rapids splash, clash."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
